Description: Per-application desktop capability broker for Linux
 A Linux desktop automation service and C library for capture, window
 inspection and control, clipboard access and compositor pointer
 operations. Applications use libkeysharp-desktop.so.0; the available
 operations depend on the active compositor.
 .
 On GNOME or Cinnamon, run "keysharp-desktop enable-extension" as the
 graphical user after installing.
